# VDT roles (shared kit)

| Role | Who | Responsibility |
|------|-----|----------------|
| **Owner** | Human | Vision, BLOCKED/Deferred, final push if they want it |
| **Orchestrator** | Main agent (Cursor or OpenCode) | `абракадабра` / `abrakadabra`: scan env → AskQuestion product → S0 disk → scan → drain → one commit + push + summary |
| **Subagents** | Task tool | Narrow tasks; results return to orchestrator |

**Do not delegate:** final `git push`, closing the sprint journal, updating NEXT_SESSION, amend after push.

## Subagents (when)

| Type | Use |
|------|-----|
| `explore` | Search docs / map routes without reading the whole tree |
| `shell` | One isolated MSYS2 command (`cargo test`, `git fetch`) |
| `generalPurpose` | One module with clear acceptance |
| `bugbot` / `security-review` / `best-of-n-runner` | Only if the owner asks; **not** in `абракадабра` / `abrakadabra` drain |

Product-specific roles (FM, test-ci, Galaxy) stay in the product repo. This kit does not replace PoolAI `poolai-agent-roles.mdc`.
